# Syr Armont, the Redeemer {3}{G}{W}, a 4/4: "When Syr Armont enters, create a Monster Role token attached to another target creature
# you control." and "Enchanted creatures you control get +1/+1." On turn three Bot1 has Memnite and Ornithopter, and Bot2 an
# Ornithopter. The trigger refuses Syr Armont itself (CR 115.1, "another") and Bot2's creature ("you control"); targeting Memnite,
# the Monster Role gives it +1/+1 and trample (CR 111.10k, 303.4) and Syr Armont's own pump +1/+1 more: 3/3. Ornithopter, with no
# Aura, stays 0/2, and so does Syr Armont, who is no enchanted creature (4/4).

